# Rebuild marker for the CI build images (#215).
#
# docker/image-hash.sh hashes docker/shared, so changing the date below gives
# every image a new inputs hash and therefore a fresh build (new OS packages)
# under a new tag. The scheduled run of the Docker Images workflow bumps it and
# opens a pull request; nothing CI uses changes until that PR is merged.
# The Ubuntu images run apt-get upgrade, as the Fedora and Oracle ones run
# dnf update, so a refresh also updates the base image's own packages.
